# Integrations

- Exactly one Jira Cloud environment and one Azure DevOps Services environment in the pilot
- Per assessment: one representative Jira project and one ADO repository
- Credentials encrypted/server-side; never echo full secrets after save
- Use read-only scopes only
- Evidence collection is snapshot-based for a lookback window, not continuous sync sprawl
- Test-connection and project/repo refresh are backend operations with clear error states
- Frontend `Integrations` / `SetupWizard` / `EvidencePreview` screens define the UX contract
